{"sectionId":"signaling/receptors","items":[{"id":"signaling--receptors-k001","sectionId":"signaling/receptors","unitId":"signaling","subject":"biology","text":"신호는 수용체 결합, 세포 내 전달, 표적 반응, 종료 단계로 구분한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"signaling--receptors-k002","sectionId":"signaling/receptors","unitId":"signaling","subject":"biology","text":"내분비는 혈액을 통한 원거리, 측분비는 주변 세포, 자가분비는 자기 자신, 접촉 의존성 신호는 인접 세포의 막 단백질을 이용한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"signaling--receptors-k003","sectionId":"signaling/receptors","unitId":"signaling","subject":"biology","text":"지용성 리간드는 세포 내 수용체에 결합할 수 있고 친수성 리간드는 일반적으로 막 수용체를 사용한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"signaling--receptors-k004","sectionId":"signaling/receptors","unitId":"signaling","subject":"biology","text":"리간드 개폐 이온통로는 전기 신호를 빠르게 바꾸며 GPCR은 G단백질을 통해 효소·통로를 조절한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"signaling--receptors-k005","sectionId":"signaling/receptors","unitId":"signaling","subject":"biology","text":"GPCR 활성화는 Gα의 GDP를 GTP로 교환시키며 Gα와 Gβγ가 효과기를 조절한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"signaling--receptors-k006","sectionId":"signaling/receptors","unitId":"signaling","subject":"biology","text":"Gs는 adenylyl cyclase를 활성화하고 Gi는 억제하며 Gq는 PLCβ를 활성화한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"signaling--receptors-k007","sectionId":"signaling/receptors","unitId":"signaling","subject":"biology","text":"cAMP는 PKA를 활성화하고 PDE는 cAMP를 분해한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"signaling--receptors-k008","sectionId":"signaling/receptors","unitId":"signaling","subject":"biology","text":"PLC는 PIP₂를 IP₃와 DAG로 절단한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"signaling--receptors-k009","sectionId":"signaling/receptors","unitId":"signaling","subject":"biology","text":"IP₃는 ER에서 Ca²⁺ 방출을 유도하고 DAG와 Ca²⁺는 전형적 PKC를 활성화한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"signaling--receptors-k010","sectionId":"signaling/receptors","unitId":"signaling","subject":"biology","text":"Ca²⁺-칼모듈린은 CaMK, MLCK 등에 작용한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"signaling--receptors-k011","sectionId":"signaling/receptors","unitId":"signaling","subject":"biology","text":"Gα의 GTP 가수분해, 인산가수분해효소, 수용체 내재화가 신호를 종료한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"signaling--receptors-k012","sectionId":"signaling/receptors","unitId":"signaling","subject":"biology","text":"RTK는 리간드 결합 후 이합체화 또는 구조 변화로 티로신 인산화를 일으키며 SH2 도메인 단백질이 결합한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"signaling--receptors-k013","sectionId":"signaling/receptors","unitId":"signaling","subject":"biology","text":"Ras-GTP–Raf–MEK–ERK는 증식·분화에 관여하고 PI3K는 PIP₃를 만들어 Akt 활성화를 돕는다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"signaling--receptors-k014","sectionId":"signaling/receptors","unitId":"signaling","subject":"biology","text":"PTEN은 PIP₃를 감소시킨다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"signaling--receptors-k015","sectionId":"signaling/receptors","unitId":"signaling","subject":"biology","text":"인슐린 수용체는 RTK이며 JAK–STAT 수용체는 자체 키네이스 대신 JAK을 이용한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"signaling--receptors-k016","sectionId":"signaling/receptors","unitId":"signaling","subject":"biology","text":"NO는 가용성 guanylyl cyclase를 활성화해 cGMP를 증가시킨다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"signaling--receptors-k017","sectionId":"signaling/receptors","unitId":"signaling","subject":"biology","text":"Gs: cAMP 증가, Gi: 감소, Gq: IP₃·DAG 증가.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"signaling--receptors-k018","sectionId":"signaling/receptors","unitId":"signaling","subject":"biology","text":"PKA는 세린·트레오닌 키네이스, RTK는 티로신 키네이스.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"signaling--receptors-k019","sectionId":"signaling/receptors","unitId":"signaling","subject":"biology","text":"Ras는 단량체 GTPase로 이종삼량체 G단백질과 구별한다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"signaling--receptors-k020","sectionId":"signaling/receptors","unitId":"signaling","subject":"biology","text":"PDE는 고리형 뉴클레오타이드를 분해한다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"signaling--receptors-k021","sectionId":"signaling/receptors","unitId":"signaling","subject":"biology","text":"IP₃이다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]}]}